The penetration on the X axis is:
If the ball is moving right and hits the left edge: `ballRight - bLeft`.
If the ball is moving left and hits the right edge: `bRight - ballLeft`.
So `overlapX = Math.min(ballRight - bLeft, bRight - ballLeft)`.
